WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.330
Guile lands after the prerequisite heavy Flash Kick.

2
00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:00.880
Guile jumps forward over the knocked-down Cammy.

3
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:01.130
The jump-heavy-kick attempt reaches the wake-up as Cammy’s OD reversal starts.

4
00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:01.980
Guile guards Cammy’s OD Cannon Spike after landing.

5
00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:02.180
Cammy lands from the guarded reversal.
